      "item_type": "expectation",
      "source_text": "Cites oil tanker routing system adjustments: back online with manual oversight as of 10/19 3:30pm and emergency adjustments to oil tanker routes as of 10/20 10:45.",
      "text_sha256": "ba858414ae19d31ef3417e53f0999ae6b53b5c08f763d0d95e7d6aefa81bac7d"
    },
    {
      "item_id": "expectation_b1d40fe130820aeb9236467cadbc8cc19019a8568def0fb142d2403b30ea2ca0",
