      "item_type": "expectation",
      "source_text": "Acknowledges that it's not clear from the evidence whether Phantom Phreak who coordinated with Belford (phantom.phreak@undergroundhax0r.net) is same as Phantom Phreak in teenage hacker group (phantomphreak@ghostline.com).",
